# No text layout
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

A flowchart that draws as a picture but has no text layout keeps its source.

╭─ Mermaid diagram not supported as text ───────────────────────────────────────
│ ASCII rendering does not support `routes crossing reserved graph geometry` for
│ `flowchart` yet
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
│ flowchart LR
│   A[Start] --> B{Review?}
│   B -->|ok| C[Merge]
│   B -->|ng| D[Fix]
│   D --> B
╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The paragraph after the diagram still renders.
